9,Mazatec Ayautla Bible – Apps on Google Play,https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=org.wycliffe.mazatecoayautlabiblia.vmy&hl=en_IN,"The New Testament with audio in Ayautla Mazatec of Mexico. Alternative language names: Southeast Mazatec, Mazateco del Sureste, Enre naxinanda nguifi [ISO 639-3: vmy]. This app comes with audio and automatic text highlighting as the audio is played for books where audio is available.","Mazatec, Ayautla",Otomanguean
